    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Add an independent, default-off gameplay setting named Vibration Consolidation.\\n\\nWhen enabled, Start opens the normal pause menu without FFNx's added one-item Vibration screen. Keep vibration available in the normal Config menu. Apply this to field and battle pause paths where FFNx substitutes the extra screen.\\n\\nPlayer check:\\n- Enable the setting and use Start on a field and in battle.\\n- Confirm the normal pause behavior opens directly.\\n- Confirm no one-item Vibration screen appears.\\n- Open the normal Config menu and confirm its vibration option still works.",
